          }
        },
        "text_TDJzpY": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Hartwick Atelier is a fresh arrival on the slow fashion scene, presenting a euro chic ready-to-wear collection in finely-tailored artisanal fabrics and a handcrafted jewellery line that dazzles with hand-carved precious stones and fine gold.</p><p>Founder and Creative Director Angela Hartwick’s elegant lifestyle collection brings together the work of masters in Indian heritage craft with her years working as a stylist and filmmaker in Paris, Dubai and Mumbai. </p><p>Showcasing the analogue beauty of handspun and handwoven fabrics, hand block prints, natural dyes, fine tailoring, and handcarved precious gems – each handcrafted piece in her collection is a glimpse into the rich history and intricate process that has gone into its creation. </p><p>The scope of the collection is a reflection of its founder’s own lifestyle, a spectacular and fascinating blend of cultures, elegance and earthiness. Her ethos comes together in this luscious offering with authentic range. </p><p></p>",
            "text_size": "text-std",
            "alignment": "center",
            "text_indent": "noindent"
          }
        }
