        "text_H3pmTU": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "description": "<p>This collection came together over decades of world travel as creatives in fashion and film. At first glance, it’s an elegant lifestyle brand with a distinct character and gorgeous texture. But at its roots, this collection is a portrait of nature and sustainability through refined handcraft. It’s an analogue love story\", says Angela Hartwick, Founder and Creative Director. </p>"
